WEBVTT

00:00:01.049 --> 00:00:04.133
OnlyTranslate includes a local EPUB reader.

00:00:05.585 --> 00:00:09.114
Import an ebook to generate bilingual content chapter by chapter.

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:17.901
Both the original and translation remain visible, so you can compare them whenever you like.

00:00:22.357 --> 00:00:26.791
Turn to the next chapter and the translation quickly follows—translate as you read.
